/* Full-bleed accent band; :host owns the background (spec § Hero — full-bleed accent band,
   § Contrast: --ngpt-hero-gradient's stops are lightness-only variations of
   --ngpt-accent-surface, not --ngpt-accent — deliberately darker so white text/lede/buttons all
   clear AA at every stop, incl. the lightest — see docs/decisions.md). The overflow clip the
   decorative shape needs lives on .hero-band__clip, not :host.

   Navbar (variant="band") is now a sibling BEFORE this element in home.html, not projected
   content — a sticky child can't stick past its containing block's own box, and that box used to
   end with the hero, stopping the sticky navbar dead at the features section. As a normal-flow
   sibling, navbar reserves its own height at the top of the page; this negative margin pulls the
   hero-band up underneath it so the band still starts at the very top, under the transparent
   navbar, matching the original overlay look. */
